      "css_067_bug_impact": "css_0.67 从 14→48 edges（bug 修复后 majority-vote 正确纳入），css_1.00 保持 14 edges 不变"
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: SVA Circuit Discovery Summary (k=50 re-run)",
        "description": "行: EAP-IG, EP, ACDC, CSS≥2/3, CSS=1.0 列: Edges, Mean CPR, Mean CMD, Δ(vs best single) CSS=1.0 的 14 edges 在 mean ablation 下 CPR=1.210 > ACDC 1.175\n"
